      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. it just feels like a loop. like, if life is just a series of random events with no objective purpose, then everything is basically zero. if the sum of everything is zero, then there's no mathematical difference between staying or leaving. it's all just neutral. how can you say there's a \"reason\" when there's literally no logical basis for one existing?",
