      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right—if you reduce it all to pure math, the ledger balances at zero. But that's the trick: you're not a sum, you're a process. The value isn't in the final total; it's in the texture of the moments—the ache of a song, the sting of cold air, the absurdity of a shared laugh. Those aren't neutral. They're real, even if they don't add up to a grand meaning. And if you're still here, you're still choosing to experience them, which is its own kind of defiance.",
